# Accepted trivy findings for the starter infrastructure. Every entry carries
# its justification; review these whenever the referenced module changes.

# AZU-0021 / AZU-0026 are written for the retired PostgreSQL Single Server and
# look for its parameter names ("connection_throttling", ssl_enforcement /
# ssl_minimal_tls_version_enforced). We run Flexible Server and set the
# equivalents explicitly in modules/postgresql/main.tf:
#   connection_throttle.enable = on, require_secure_transport = on,
#   ssl_min_protocol_version = TLSv1.2
AZU-0021
AZU-0026

# AZU-0017 (LOW): the Key Vault secrets (postgres-admin-password,
# orders-db-connection) are generated by Terraform and rotated by replacing
# random_password.admin. A hard expiry would make Container Apps fail to
# resolve the reference at an arbitrary date without a rotation job; add one
# together with automated rotation.
AZU-0017
